        "cooked": "<p>Marot's Folly</p><p>I wanted to give the Folly a bit of glamour. &nbsp;This is Marot on a winning streak, with money to spend. &nbsp;But every lucky streak ends, and someday it will be time to run....</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/302c75541e8d3e1209093bff1941cf9f3e311425.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/302c75541e8d3e1209093bff1941cf9f3e311425\" title=\"Marot&amp;#39;s Folly.JPG\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/302c75541e8d3e1209093bff1941cf9f3e311425_2_373x499.jpeg\" alt=\"Marot's Folly.JPG\" data-base62-sha1=\"6SaaxNeUylvG4Cjj822RW9RusXH\" width=\"373\" height=\"499\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/302c75541e8d3e1209093bff1941cf9f3e311425_2_373x499.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/302c75541e8d3e1209093bff1941cf9f3e311425_2_559x748.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/302c75541e8d3e1209093bff1941cf9f3e311425.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/302c75541e8d3e1209093bff1941cf9f3e311425_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Marot&amp;#39;s Folly.JPG</span><span class=\"informations\">624×835 186 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
